  "body": "Opened by the maintainer's session on behalf of tbrasselle, who cannot open PRs under the current repository setting; every commit is theirs.\n\n**What changed:** per the author's issue comment, the diff is exactly `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/fill.rs` and `crates/motion/tests/finish3d_land.rs` (+72/-3). Each closed opening's lid now gets one flat plane instead of churning retract/plunge at every lid step edge. The branch also merges current main (`16ff652d`).\n\n**How tested:** the author reports the gates green (\"gates green\" in their comment). Pinning test: `a_pocket_under_a_descending_roof_gets_one_flat_lid` in `crates/motion/tests/finish3d_land.rs` (the test name is taken from the diff; the author's comment does not name it).\n\n**Not exercised:** not stated by the author.\n\nChangelog: Stepped lids in 3D finishing get one flat lid per closed opening instead of retract/plunge churn at every step edge (#1412, PR #M)\n\nFixes #1412\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
